    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act, As amended by the Land Acquisition(Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intendsto accquire the following land which is required for a publicpurpose :-",
