      343.69,
      547.07,
      366.76
    ],
    "text": "of one overhead water tank (under construction) and twopits; Claimant: State; Extent: 0.3163 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.05,
      378.49,
      547.11,
      509.56
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land are herebyrequired to appear personally or by agent duly authorized inwriting, before me at Valikamam South West, SandilippayDivisional Secretariat office on 03rd March 2017 at 10.00 a.mand are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (induplicate) on or before the 20th February 2017 the nature oftheir interests in the land, the particulars of their claims forcompensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amountof compensation and the details of the computation of suchamount. All deeds and Documents in support of claim shouldbe produced before me at the inquiry.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
